"| `QuantumCircuit.hamiltonian` | [`HamiltonianGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.HamiltonianGate)    |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.isometry`    | [`Isometry`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.Isometry)           |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.iso`         | [`Isometry`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.Isometry)           |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.uc`          | [`UCGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.UCGate)               |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.ucrx`        | [`UCRXGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.UCRXGate)           |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.ucry`        | [`UCRYGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.UCRYGate)           |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.ucrz`        | [`UCRZGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.UCRZGate)           |\n"

